plan error: AnalyzerError: Unsupported pattern: composite FK-edge join has FK and node-id columns that are the same set of names in DIFFERENT order (FkEdgeJoin Left: ["region", "person_id"] vs ["person_id", "region"]). The join pairs columns positionally, so this would silently cross them (e.g. `region = person_id AND person_id = region`) and return wrong rows. Declare the FK columns in the SAME order as the target node_id columns. (#672)